// [LESSON]: Alloy 6 does not allow the 'in' operator with set comprehensions like User & (u: User | u.isAdmin = True); must use {u: User | u.isAdmin = True} for set comprehension.
// [LESSON]: Alloy 6 requires all predicate parameters to have explicit type annotations and to be separated by commas; cannot use parameters without types in predicate headers.
// [LESSON]: Alloy 6 does not support parameterized open of util/seq (e.g., open util/seq[Request]) → Must use open util/seq as Seq and use Seq/Seq[Type] for sequence-typed fields.
